const phaseLabels:any={night:'夜の行動',morning:'朝の結果',discussion:'議論',vote:'投票',revote:'再投票',execution:'投票結果'};const roles=[['市民','能力はありません。すべての人狼を見つけることが勝利条件です。'],['占い師','夜に1人を占い、人狼か人間かを知ります。'],['霊媒師','処刑された人の陣営を翌朝に確認します。'],['騎士','夜に1人を襲撃から守ります。自分は守れません。'],['共有者','他の共有者を知っており、夜に専用チャットで会話できます。'],['人狼','夜に襲撃先を選びます。人狼同士を知っています。'],['狂人','人狼陣営。人狼を知らず、占いでは人間判定です。'],['狂言者','人狼陣営。人狼を知りますが、人狼はあなたを知りません。']];const roleDefaults:any=recommendedRoles(8);const defaults:any={...roleDefaults,method:'individual',nightSeconds:30,nightProgression:'auto',rolecheckProgression:'auto',pointsEnabled:true,hostMode:'player',gmRevealRoles:false,spectatorRevealRoles:false,special:{open:false,firstDayWhite:false},voteDisclosure:'none',themeScope:'personal',themePresetId:''};
type SoundKind='tap'|'phase'|'night'|'vote'|'attack'|'guard'|'divination'|'medium'|'victory';
let chatMessageSequence=0;
function newChatMessageId(){
 try{const cryptoApi=globalThis.crypto;if(typeof cryptoApi?.randomUUID==='function')return cryptoApi.randomUUID()}catch{/* Older embedded browsers may not expose randomUUID. */}
 chatMessageSequence=(chatMessageSequence+1)%0x1000000;
 return `${Date.now().toString(36)}-${Math.random().toString(36).slice(2)}-${chatMessageSequence.toString(36)}`;
}
function playSound(contextRef:React.MutableRefObject<AudioContext|null>,enabled:boolean,kind:SoundKind='tap'){
 if(!enabled||typeof window==='undefined')return;
 try{
  const AudioCtor=window.AudioContext||(window as any).webkitAudioContext;if(!AudioCtor)return;
  const ctx=contextRef.current||(contextRef.current=new AudioCtor());if(ctx.state==='suspended')void ctx.resume();
  const tone=(frequency:number,delay:number,duration:number,wave:OscillatorType='sine',volume=.04,endFrequency=frequency)=>{const start=ctx.currentTime+delay,osc=ctx.createOscillator(),gain=ctx.createGain();osc.type=wave;osc.frequency.setValueAtTime(frequency,start);if(endFrequency!==frequency)osc.frequency.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(Math.max(1,endFrequency),start+duration);gain.gain.setValueAtTime(.0001,start);gain.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(volume*.72,start+.012);gain.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(.0001,start+duration);osc.connect(gain);gain.connect(ctx.destination);osc.start(start);osc.stop(start+duration+.015)};
  const wind=(delay:number,duration:number,volume=.025,low=350,high=1800)=>{const length=Math.max(1,Math.ceil(ctx.sampleRate*duration)),buffer=ctx.createBuffer(1,length,ctx.sampleRate),data=buffer.getChannelData(0);for(let i=0;i<length;i++)data[i]=Math.random()*2-1;const source=ctx.createBufferSource(),filter=ctx.createBiquadFilter(),gain=ctx.createGain(),start=ctx.currentTime+delay;source.buffer=buffer;filter.type='bandpass';filter.frequency.setValueAtTime(high,start);filter.frequency.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(low,start+duration);filter.Q.value=.55;gain.gain.setValueAtTime(.0001,start);gain.gain.linearRampToValueAtTime(volume*.72,start+.08);gain.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(.0001,start+duration);source.connect(filter);filter.connect(gain);gain.connect(ctx.destination);source.start(start);source.stop(start+duration)};
  switch(kind){
   case 'tap':tone(175,0,.09,'triangle',.018,115);tone(720,.012,.12,'sine',.012,520);break;
   case 'phase':[392,523,659,784].forEach((n,i)=>tone(n,i*.105,.48,'triangle',.032));break;
   case 'night':wind(0,.75,.032,180,1100);tone(110,.08,.8,'sine',.028,82);tone(164.8,.22,.6,'triangle',.016,130);break;
   case 'vote':tone(105,0,.18,'sine',.075,52);tone(330,.07,.16,'triangle',.04,220);tone(247,.22,.2,'triangle',.03,165);break;
   case 'attack':wind(0,.34,.038,240,3200);tone(220,.12,.2,'sawtooth',.027,72);tone(82,.19,.28,'sine',.045,48);break;
   case 'guard':tone(560,0,.34,'triangle',.045,420);tone(840,.015,.24,'sine',.025,670);tone(1110,.035,.2,'sine',.014,880);break;
   case 'divination':[659,880,1175,1568].forEach((n,i)=>tone(n,i*.12,.6,'sine',.024));break;
   case 'medium':wind(0,.62,.023,260,1250);tone(196,.03,.62,'sine',.027,146.8);tone(293.7,.2,.48,'triangle',.019,220);break;
   case 'victory':[392,493.9,587.3,784,1046.5].forEach((n,i)=>tone(n,i*.11,.62,'triangle',.036));break;
  }
 }catch{/* 効果音が利用できない環境では無音で続行 */}
}
